      "id": "2076737992689914215",
      "text": "SpaceX policy regarding data retention.\n\nIt is actually helpful for debugging issues if we can retain some amount of data, so allowing this would be appreciated, but your privacy settings are always respected.",
      "created_at": "Mon Jul 13 18:38:16 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": null,
      "quoted": {
        "id": "2076692402442846289",
        "text": "We care deeply about your privacy and respect customer choice. For teams using zero data retention, no trace and code data is ever retained. All API key use of Grok Build also respects ZDR. \n\nIf ZDR is disabled, the /privacy command is available in the CLI to disable data retention, which also deletes previously synced data.\n\nRun the /privacy command to view or change your settings at any time.",
        "created_at": "Mon Jul 13 15:37:06 +0000 2026",
        "lang": "en",
        "media": [],
        "retweet": null,
        "quoted": null,
