    {
      "id": "2076739687658496209",
      "text": "True. \n\nAs a precautionary measure, all user data that was uploaded to SpaceXAI before now will be completely and utterly deleted. Zero anything whatsoever will remain.",
      "created_at": "Mon Jul 13 18:45:00 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": null,
      "quoted": {
        "id": "2076693464016994685",
        "text": "I worked on building an end-to-end encrypted email/docs/files/calendar app @skiffprivacy for 4 years and care deeply about privacy. \n\nZDR and /privacy are always respected in Grok Build - and swapping your setting with /privacy deletes any synced data retoractively",
