      "quoted": {
        "id": "2076639388805804140",
        "text": "Grok Build is growing insanely fast, reaching 1.16 million monthly visits within just weeks after its early-beta launch\n\nTraffic jumped from around 460,000 visits in May to 1.16 million in June\n\nThat’s growth of more than 150% in just one month\n\nGrok Build with Grok 4.5 ranked #1 on the SWE-Atlas-QnA benchmark with a score of 84, ahead of Claude Code with Fable 5 on the benchmark\n\nMore developers are discovering Grok Build and realizing how capable Grok 4.5 actually is for real coding work\n\nGrok Build is quickly taking over the AI coding space",
